<title>GERMANY: MG to book profit from Metall bank in 96/97.</title>
<headline>MG to book profit from Metall bank in 96/97.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Germany's Metallgesellschaft AG said on Wednesday it will book the profit from its October 1 sale of Metallbank GmbH to SchmidtBank KGaA and that the proceeds would flow into its 1996/97 balance sheet.</p>
<p>MG's financial year ends on September 30.</p>
<p>An MG spokesman said that the two sides had agreed to remain silent on the price paid, but that it was a &quot;good price&quot;.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
